# Room Hire Scheduler

A lightweight static prototype that demonstrates capturing room-hire bookings while keeping the booking details visible after the reservation is added to the calendar.

## Getting started

Open `index.html` in a browser. Use the “New booking” button to launch the form, add the reservation, and see it plotted across the room-by-time calendar grid. The prototype stores entries only in browser memory—there is no shared database or backend service.
